  "bio": "Dominic Holmes, also known as @pepax.official, is a tattoo artist based in Omaha, NE who specializes in 'black&gray' style. His work, showcased at @skinlessportraits, highlights his impressive skill level and a keen eye for detail which have made him a sought-after artist in the industry. Along with his exceptional artistic abilities, Dominic's high level of cleanliness in his Big Brain prod studio assures a safe and comfortable experience for all clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nArtist @theoaktattoo \n112 N 9th st Omaha, NE 68102\nArt page- @skinlessportraits DHtheoak@yahoo.com for tattoo appointment inquiries",
